  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.0: Migrated to .NET Standard 2.0 for maximum compatibility.\n      Updated Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions to 3.1.20.\n      Version 1.1.0: Major feature update with advanced preparation capabilities.\n      - TrimAllProperties() method for recursive string trimming across nested objects\n      - Include() method for reusing preparation configurations (similar to FluentValidation)\n      - Collection support with EmptyIfNull(), NullIfEmpty(), RemoveNulls(), RemoveDuplicates(), LimitTo()\n      - List-specific operations including Sort() with custom comparisons\n      - DateTime preparation with ToUtc(), ToLocalTime(), ToDateOnly(), DefaultIfMinValue()\n      - Numeric preparation with Clamp() and DefaultIfZero() methods\n      - Enhanced string operations: Truncate(), PadToLength(), Replace(), RemoveCharacters(), DefaultIfEmpty()\n      - Improved reflection utilities for deep object processing\n      - Better type-specific preparers for DateTime, numeric types, and collections",
  "repository": "",
